Package: epub2m4b
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: EPUB2M4B contributors <maintainers@epub2m4b.invalid>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.14), libc6, ffmpeg, ca-certificates
Recommends: libsecret-1-0
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Description: terminal audiobook studio for EPUB books
 EPUB2M4B converts EPUB ebooks into resumable, chaptered M4B audiobooks.
 It provides a guided terminal interface, selectable voice previews, guarded
 cost estimates, durable audio caching, and FFmpeg-based M4B assembly.
